    <div class="description-paragraph">Thirty percent by weight PEWax 1000 was hand mixed with 70% HDPE1. The blend was extruded at 190° C. to form a film. The film was annealed at 100° C. for 10 minutes then stretched on an Instron at 95° C. The results are set out in Table 2.</div>
    <div class="description-paragraph">
      <tables id="TABLE-US-00002">
        <patent-tables frame="none" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
          <table align="left" colsep="0" rowsep="0" cols="5" class="description-table" width="100%">
            <thead>
              <tr class="description-tr">
                <td namest="1" nameend="5" rowsep="1" class="description-td" colspan="5">TABLE 2</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="description-tr">
                <td namest="1" nameend="5" align="center" rowsep="1" class="description-td" colspan="5"> </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="description-tr">
                <td class="description-td"> </td>
                <td class="description-td"> </td>
                <td class="description-td"> </td>
